<urn:atm:triage:finding/AXPE-RSH-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AXPE-RSH-001" ;
  triage:title "HerdrQueueWakePump maintenance task has no termination or liveness guard" ;
  triage:description "The pump's maintenance task has no termination/liveness guard, unlike the HTTP listener task (ServerTaskTerminationGuard); a panic or abort in tick_once ends the JoinHandle silently with nothing marking the runtime degraded. Remediation: wrap the pump task in the existing guard pattern (sibling module; RULE-003) and add a negative test that an aborted pump marks readiness degraded. Deferred to the phase post-mortem follow-ups (non-blocking)." ;
